        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-LA6euvR-GoOTB2CAS_Lo8nlDCzJ0qU1hA2-VtT2NRajV8w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Went there today, amazing service and prices. Guillaume was very knowledgeable and helpful.\nWe would definitely return.",
        "time": 1749071710,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Celia Bertrand",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114703505784432899657/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQY4HanUiX_kIF9NAtgAudIGZqvo_i1DJGNEALtcVtx7NgkQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Dissapointed with the \"customer service\". I walked in today looking for paint, we were alone in the store, the clerk never came to see or greet us. After looking at the wall of paint for a while I went to see the clerk for some help. He never greeted us at all. I said \" excuse moi, juste une petite question, c'est quoi la différence entre les types peintures ?\" and he just responded with \"la qualité\". I thought he was maybe just being funny, but he never said anything more after and just looked away. I went back to the wall and looked, then decided that I wasn't going to get any help, so I left and purchased my paint at Home Depot where the man was very helpful.",
        "time": 1614794958,
        "translated": false
      }
